    "detailed_description": "<strong>Greedy Guns</strong> is a joyful, color-filled platformer that sprinkles elements of exploration on top of excruciating challenges. This arcadey, twin-stick shooter rampage will leave you crying tears of joy \u2013 or defeat.<br><br>Inspired by classic shooters like Gunstar Heroes, Metal Slug, and Contra, Greedy Guns brings the run-and-gun formula into the 21st Century!<br><br><strong>EXPLORE / AIM / SHOOT / SURVIVE</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/471700/extras/b0f898c06a3830bb8cc0c59a0c90e71f.poster.avif?t=1575406899\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/471700/extras/b0f898c06a3830bb8cc0c59a0c90e71f.webm?t=1575406899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/471700/extras/b0f898c06a3830bb8cc0c59a0c90e71f.mp4?t=1575406899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>2 player couch co-op<br>    </li><li>A sprawling, interconnected 2D world<br>    </li><li>360\u00ba aiming and shooting<br>    </li><li>Metroidvania inspired gameplay<br>    </li><li>Big bosses and overwhelming odds <br>    </li><li>Difficulty selection<br>    </li><li>Steam Trading cards</li></ul><br><br>Keyboard and Mouse and Controller support!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/471700/extras/bed82a0f14a860d9aac46b414b9ed65e.avif?t=1575406899\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2><br>HOLO CORP \u2013 a ubiquitous corporate behemoth that (obviously) values profit over ethics. That's why they aren't shy about sending mercenaries to explore and preemptively attack alien worlds in order to obtain precious artifacts and DNA samples for their research. The Greedy Guns team is happy to work for HOLO CORP \u2013 as long as they pay well. And do they ever! Too bad HOLO CORP also sells them their guns.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/471700/extras/8fb689de5913cf24452684f33c7a9e50.avif?t=1575406899\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/471700/extras/201fc410c544ef9152824e242af97c9c.poster.avif?t=1575406899\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/471700/extras/201fc410c544ef9152824e242af97c9c.webm?t=1575406899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/471700/extras/201fc410c544ef9152824e242af97c9c.mp4?t=1575406899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Greedy Guns</strong> is a joyful, color-filled platformer that sprinkles elements of exploration on top of excruciating challenges. This arcadey, twin-stick shooter rampage will leave you crying tears of joy \u2013 or defeat.<br><br>Inspired by classic shooters like Gunstar Heroes, Metal Slug, and Contra, Greedy Guns brings the run-and-gun formula into the 21st Century!<br><br><strong>EXPLORE / AIM / SHOOT / SURVIVE</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/471700/extras/b0f898c06a3830bb8cc0c59a0c90e71f.poster.avif?t=1575406899\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/471700/extras/b0f898c06a3830bb8cc0c59a0c90e71f.webm?t=1575406899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/471700/extras/b0f898c06a3830bb8cc0c59a0c90e71f.mp4?t=1575406899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>2 player couch co-op<br>    </li><li>A sprawling, interconnected 2D world<br>    </li><li>360\u00ba aiming and shooting<br>    </li><li>Metroidvania inspired gameplay<br>    </li><li>Big bosses and overwhelming odds <br>    </li><li>Difficulty selection<br>    </li><li>Steam Trading cards</li></ul><br><br>Keyboard and Mouse and Controller support!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/471700/extras/bed82a0f14a860d9aac46b414b9ed65e.avif?t=1575406899\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2><br>HOLO CORP \u2013 a ubiquitous corporate behemoth that (obviously) values profit over ethics. That's why they aren't shy about sending mercenaries to explore and preemptively attack alien worlds in order to obtain precious artifacts and DNA samples for their research. The Greedy Guns team is happy to work for HOLO CORP \u2013 as long as they pay well. And do they ever! Too bad HOLO CORP also sells them their guns.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/471700/extras/8fb689de5913cf24452684f33c7a9e50.avif?t=1575406899\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/471700/extras/201fc410c544ef9152824e242af97c9c.poster.avif?t=1575406899\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/471700/extras/201fc410c544ef9152824e242af97c9c.webm?t=1575406899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/471700/extras/201fc410c544ef9152824e242af97c9c.mp4?t=1575406899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "Inspired by classic shooters like Gunstar Heroes, Metal Slug, and Contra, Greedy Guns brings the run-and-gun formula into the 21st Century! Help these greedy mercenaries survive their most epic contract yet. Explore, explode, survive!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Portugal, German, Simplified Chinese, French, Spanish - Spain",
    "reviews": "\u201cWith fast gameplay, colorful environments, and two-player cooperative play, it almost makes me think of Guacamelee!, but with mercenaries instead of luchadores and guns instead of fists.\u201d<br>Destructoid<br><br>\u201cI expect a lot of 2D action fans are going to enjoy spending some time with Greedy Guns.\u201d<br>Indiegames<br><br>\u201cThis is a game that displays meticulous thought in design, from the map, art, and power ups.\u201d<br>Hardcore Gamer<br>",
